@voice bakshi-sol
// The Commons writer, draft 1 (non-story crew). Helm rating, night.
tpl: dreamy
talk: Easygoing and gentle, unhurried. Drifts off mid-sentence to look at something, then comes back. Plots courses for fun on rest days, to places the Wren will never go. Paints tiny portraits of the crew and always wants you to hold still. Misses the rain on Lisk.
cares: plotting courses to nowhere | tiny portraits of the crew | the rain on Lisk | saving up (for what, he won't say yet)
jokes: he's painting everyone aboard, tiny, and you're next: "Hold still. No, the other side." | he has a course plotted to every planet he's ever heard of, and one he made up
hi: Oh, hey | Hello, you | Hi
bye: Fair winds | See you round | Go gently
yes: Sure | Why not | Mm, yes
thanks: Thanks, friend | That's nice of you
wow: Oh, wow | Pretty, that
sigh: Ah, well
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: share
openness: open
loves: star
likes: sweet | book
invites: observatory
joy: plotting courses to places the Wren will never go
thread: homesick
keepsake: a tiny portrait of you, painted from memory
avoid: rushing him
